Small checkpoints for gpt-oss's tests

gpt-oss-bf16/ and gpt-oss-mxfp4/ hold random weights that
test/gen/reference.py draws, with the shapes of gpt-oss's tiny test
checkpoints.

tokenizer.json is a copy of a tokenizer.json published on huggingface.co,
cut down by test/gen/reference_text.py to the vocabulary and merges the
tests' texts reach. Its pipeline, added tokens and identifiers are those of
the original.

